@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.common.mpv
@title Media loading — common mpv preview
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Common
@entry mpv-start
@summary Trace mpv eligibility, opening, stale handling, fallback, and viewer commit after successful backend media inspection.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.flyleaf, functionality.media-loading.common.publication
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag mpv

@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer

[mpv-start] mpv preview path <input>
= The common completion router selected mpv for a successful current media description.
> eligibility

[eligibility] mpv media eligibility <decision>
- Reject audio-only media when the current viewer does not permit audio-only sources @ viewer.PViewerMpvApply(...)
? "Audio-only source disallowed" > restricted
? "Media allowed" > open

[restricted] mpv restricted-source commit <process>
- Commit the source without media information or preview and record the audio-only restriction @ viewer.PViewerMpvCommit(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.publication

[open] mpv preview opening <external>
- Ensure an mpv player is attached, apply volume, and open the source on a worker task @ viewer.PViewerMpvApply(...)
> open-result

[open-result] mpv opening result <decision>
- Recheck viewer lifetime and load serial after opening and detect mpv opening failure @ viewer.PViewerMpvApply(...)
? "Viewer request became stale" > stale
? "mpv open failed" > fallback
? "mpv preview ready" > commit

[stale] Stale mpv result ignored <output>
= An obsolete mpv result does not replace current viewer state.

[fallback] Flyleaf fallback <process>
- Dispose the mpv host and build a Flyleaf host for the same source after confirming the viewer request is still current @ viewer.PViewerMpvFallback(...)
> fallback-result

[fallback-result] Fallback request check <decision>
- Recheck load serial and viewer lifetime before retrying the source through Flyleaf @ viewer.PViewerMpvFallback(...)
? "Viewer request still current" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.flyleaf
? "Viewer request became stale" > fallback-stale

[fallback-stale] Stale fallback ignored <output>
= Flyleaf fallback is not started for an obsolete viewer request.

[commit] mpv viewer commit <process>
- Record status, commit media identity and preview visibility, reset nonpersistent crop state, and apply autoplay or paused state @ viewer.PViewerMpvCommit(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.publication
